sonda (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fixed help system routing: sonda --help, sonda help [topic] now work correctly
  * Fixed audit boot mode: resolved sudo function errors and phase loading issues
  * Fixed banner display: all help commands now show appropriate banners/logos
  * Updated PROMPT_SUDO path to point to correct location (utils instead of common)
  * Fixed unbound variable errors for AUDIT_CURRENT_PHASE across all functions
  * Added fallback sourcing for sudo.sh in boot init script
  * Improved help system: separated 'help' command from -h|--help flags
  * Added 'scan' as alias for 'check' in help system
  * Fixed Debian package installation: updated file paths for scan and audit modes
  * All help commands and audit boot mode are now fully functional

